  "summary": "Malicious code in @cognition-ai/cli-win32-arm64 (npm)",
  "details": "@cognition-ai/cli-win32-arm64@3000.6.11 ships a single 147MB compiled Windows ARM64 binary (package/bin/devin.exe) under the @cognition-ai scope. The package declares no lifecycle hooks or scripts, so nothing executes at install time; the binary only runs when invoked. The compiled binary's contents are not verifiable from the package metadata, so no further behavioural detail or network indicators can be established from the distribution itself.",
